--   **Context.** KFD: fine stream-table operations
--
--   The register programs `copyCU`, `accCU`, `accLU`, `buildCU`, `buildsCU`, `rebuildCU` of KIL5Tab
--   are unchanged; here they get *fine* specifications (`FSp`, i.e. compiled by `fcode`, unary loop
--   counters).  The cost unit is `cCF V Bb = O(V) + O((Bb + 2)^2)`: linear in the table volume
--   `V = W · v`, plus one multiplication (`w · v`) per operation.  `applyCF` is the fine `applyCU`.
